WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:02.540
Learning is durable change in capability.

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.140
A learner can explain more clearly, make a better decision,

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:08.260
perform a step more accurately, recognize a cue earlier,

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:10.355
or apply an idea in a new situation.

00:00:10.355 --> 00:00:14.365
Neuroplasticity helps explain why durable learning requires active engagement.

00:00:14.365 --> 00:00:17.605
The nervous system changes more reliably when learners use the skill,

00:00:17.605 --> 00:00:20.740
retrieve information, correct errors, and repeat the process over time.

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:23.520
Memory formation is practical, not just academic.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.380
People need to encode information, revisit it, retrieve it,

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.280
and connect it to existing knowledge.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:31.920
Practice and retrieval matter because they force the learner to bring information back and

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:32.370
use it.

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:33.780
Rereading may feel fluent,

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:37.760
but recall and application provide stronger evidence that the learning is available when

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:38.215
needed.

00:00:38.215 --> 00:00:42.470
Repetition with variation helps skill formation because real work rarely looks exactly

00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:43.300
like the lesson.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.460
Exact repetition can build familiarity,

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:48.360
but variation teaches what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:52.290
A learner who practices several versions of a task is more likely to recognize the

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:53.750
underlying pattern later.

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:57.715
Feedback and correction make those repetitions useful rather than simply familiar.

00:00:57.715 --> 00:01:01.665
Automaticity can develop when parts of a skill are practiced enough that they require less

00:01:01.665 --> 00:01:02.380
conscious effort.

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:05.360
That can free attention for judgment, monitoring, and adaptation.

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:07.400
But automaticity is not perfection.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.800
It needs safeguards, review, and continued feedback when the stakes are high.

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:14.930
Neuroplasticity supports skill development, but it does not replace deliberate practice,

00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:16.900
good design, or responsible review.
